; вариант 13

PEREVOZ FUNCTION RN,D4
.1,3/.3,5/.6,4/1,2

GRUZ STORAGE 3

VREMZAN VARIABLE FR$DISP*600/1000

        GENERATE 15,10

        QUEUE OCHERED
        SEIZE DISP
        DEPART OCHERED
        ADVANCE 3,1
        RELEASE DISP

        ENTER GRUZ,1
        ADVANCE FN$PEREVOZ
        LEAVE GRUZ,1

        TERMINATE

        GENERATE 600
        SAVEVALUE ZANAT,V$VREMZAN
        TERMINATE 1

START 1
